      "side": 1,
      "message": "Following Zephyr\u0027s configuration principles, hardware configuration goes in device tree, software configuration goes in kconfig: https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/guides/dts/dt-vs-kconfig.html\n\nThis certainly falls in the software realm instead of hardware.\n\nThus, I propose we follow a simpler solution: kconfig booleans to enable/disable console channels.  This can just set CC_DEFAULT in config_chip.h as the translation layer.",
      "revId": "7a5587939ea7f2370b999bedbba3b8d52421994e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
