      "writtenOn": "2021-02-17T20:11:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In theory we could do this, however, I think faft requires that we are able to enable certain console channels that were disabled at build-time using the \"chan\" command.\n\nSo rather sadly, these strings/prints need to stay :(",
      "parentUuid": "d5d36ea2_b7a66e59",
